    ds4-bench: per-step decode logits hash and dump
    
    DS4_BENCH_DECODE_LOGITS_HASH=1 prints an FNV-1a hash of every decode
    step's full logits, outside the timed region, to compare arms bit for bit;
    DS4_BENCH_DECODE_LOGITS_DUMP=path also appends the raw F32 logits for KL
    checks. The encoder timeline keeps longer kernel names.

diff --git a/ds4_bench.c b/ds4_bench.c
